  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a clay tajine vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the cumin, cayenne pepper, salt, and paprika. Stir well.",
    "Add the halved datterini tomatoes to the tajine vessel.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and let it simmer for 2 minutes.",
    "Transfer the tajine vessel to the oven and bake for 15 minutes at 375°F.",
    "Remove the tajine vessel from the oven and let it rest for 2-3 minutes before serving."
